Comment: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Comment: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know how early it is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to be like this every day, aren't you. What do you want today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man. C'mon, you can't--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.17,0:00:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato and Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you helping him out again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be so nice to have her around, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is it so important to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let your guard down, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take your eyes off him for a second and I'm sure he'll hurt himself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found this, let me pin it up for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't just go and--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What else shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday was the library, and the day before college.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you had the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How many times have I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not pity or self-sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, stop bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you go for walks, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Walks are great fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only one who has that much fun with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go somewhere fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they went out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like that for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've been all scrunched up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I wanted you to have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See, there's boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's ride one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, a boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think it costs money, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna hit something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! You're hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you werry about that, we're never going to make it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never make it back...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get us there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't dip the oar that deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.28,0:05:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Use your legs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Such an optimist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten a little better up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm trying to cheer Fujimoto up. Next we're going to feed the fishies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I meant! Don't you understand the mess you're in!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I spent more money on Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But at least I got change!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it! What do you even thing I'm talking about!? You're out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.55,0:06:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I'm trying my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! I'm not done talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, fishie, fishie! Dinnertime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:06:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't calm down with you following me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Kobato, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't get a whole bunch of candy--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's just you, Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you on a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The weather's great today, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with all this lollygagging!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're enough of a flake to get through, you tell her what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! She's forgotten all about her wish, she's just flaking around lollygagging!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:08:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know exactly what I wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's Dobato up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Being a Dobato, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you mad, Ioryogi?{no. no, i'm not doing it. even if i wanted to, kohaku would never say it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn straight I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm mad, but I can't help it when she makes that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's made her choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a reason for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So nothing is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that how it works in Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or does it apply us from the spirit world too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's true for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great, I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so hung up on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you just want to thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're barking up the wrong tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing you need to be grateful for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't expect anything more, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I'm worried about someone I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, Sayaka told me to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't she important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can go see her anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just like Ioryogi sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're both always mad about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.65,0:10:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi's that stuffed animal you always haul around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's really special!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You made your choice too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How are you doing your laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Drying it out must be really tough like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to spend tomorrow with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're happy about it, I'm happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.75,0:12:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for everything you've done for me. I'm sorry I can't say goodbye to Chiho and Chise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you talked with Sayaka yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling her next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already been a year since you moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Four seasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spring, summer, fall, and winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were all so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once you get settled in at your new place, get in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. As soon as I get settled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've decided exactly what I wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what that means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry up with the candy--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you care what happens to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A perfect 100 points on the idiot scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you said your goodbyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess it's goodbye to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this really how you want to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, the moon's so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure you'll be happy just being by his side?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who would I not be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just being with him is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought she'd have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must have been too hard for her to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did she say where she was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, just that she'd be in touch when she settled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! She tried hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She may be stupid, may be clumsy, may be a flake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She may be too positive and too honest for her own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that's exactly how humans are supposed to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.91,0:16:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's done great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please! You can't--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't just end her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.51,0:17:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know the Bunny can't do that, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even in the end, you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I am! You can't just disappear without saying anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did I hurt your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because of the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of her suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's... a stuffed animal...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's just what I pretend to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, about that contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. Show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.51,0:19:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's soul doesn't belong to any world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It wanders, attached to no life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But thanks to a contract with someone higher up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,she had the chance to be reborn just one time and live life over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what is this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.57,0:19:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She was more worried about spending her time with you than fulfilling the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thus, the contract...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I have to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was very happy when I was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is no good...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to say goodbye with a smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the person I care the most about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The candy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's filling up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's wish has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But the contract can't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll go to the place that she wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.63,0:21:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's candy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.41,0:21:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.39,0:21:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a gift, it's a curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please! Let her be reborn in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.49,0:22:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't apologize. I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.41,0:22:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been by her side the longest...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But there's a reason for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.83,0:22:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's somewhere I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.79,0:22:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.92,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.92,0:01:15.22,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.22,0:01:25.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.52,0:01:30.81,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.82,0:01:38.57,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.57,0:01:44.24,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.24,0:01:49.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.46,0:01:55.76,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.76,0:02:01.43,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.43,0:02:08.14,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.14,0:02:16.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.07,0:03:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Kobato's Wish
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.02,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1\fs22\shad0\fad(500,0)\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(105,384)}Next episode: "Tomorrow..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:05.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,In between the things I've lost
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.94,0:23:11.49,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,and the things I've been able to hold on to,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:19.92,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Your smile falls in that gap
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:26.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like I can reach it, but I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.17,0:23:31.43,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.05,0:23:37.93,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to make you smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.93,0:23:43.40,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My two wings weren't good enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:48.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I even have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:55.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just smiling by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:24:00.21,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:07.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just warming you is good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.34,0:24:11.80,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,even though I want to embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:19.06,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even with these scarred, worthless wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:27.65,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,right now I can smile
